# Downloaded/cached market reference and historical data (real, large,
# regenerable via scripts/fetch_upstox_historical.py and
# app/data/providers/upstox_instrument_master.py's cache) -- never committed.
# Anchored to the repo root ONLY -- an unanchored `data/` here previously
# also matched `app/data/` (providers/normalization/ingestion/validation,
# real source code), which meant that entire subsystem was silently
# excluded from every commit since this repo's first one. Found and fixed
# 2026-09-13 during Phase 3 audit; see the dedicated fix commit.
/data/

